// [69] M3 native build gate (): the committed portfolio passes the --run gate; --summary-out creates
// its parent dir + summary; a committed .sol classified non-native is rejected; and a
// native-validated-but-uncompilable .sol fails the --run gate deterministically (solc present or not).
// See check_native_build_gate.py.
//
// RUN: python3 %S/check_native_build_gate.py %scripts/gates/native_build_gate.py %examples
